# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit these. Production values live on the VPS only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# The owner's working notes. This folder holds the LIVE Stripe secret key, the
# Supabase service_role JWT and the database password in plain text — it is the
# single most dangerous thing in this tree and it must never reach a remote.
# Excluded by name AND by the two patterns below, because a folder named in
# Arabic is easy to mistype and a near-miss here is silent.
ملف التقرير المالي eventsli/
*التقرير المالي*
**/New Text Document.txt

